cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Onset imputation by back-sampling reporting delays: an interactive demonstration"
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it as below. The code was
  generated by an LLM and only the interactive page has been checked by
  the author.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Abbott
    given-names: Sam
    email: sam.abbott@lshtm.ac.uk
    affiliation: London School of Hygiene & Tropical Medicine
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0000-0001-8057-8037
abstract: >-
  An interactive page, JavaScript module and Python simulation exploring
  bias from imputing missing symptom-onset dates by subtracting a delay
  drawn from pooled empirical onset-to-report delays. Compares this with a
  mean shift, a draw from the forward delay and EM back-projection under
  time-varying growth, delays, missingness and ascertainment.
license: MIT
